{"id":"n28548-1-8","stage":5,"title":"내용물 · 内容物","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28548-1-8-1","ko":"택배를 보내려고 하는데 비용이 얼마인가요?","zh":"我想寄快递，费用是多少呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"택배를","meaning":"快递","explanation":"택배：快递；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"택배","audio":"/audio/b63128abe65a84d203c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80833","senseId":"1","lemma":"택배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보내려고","meaning":"送，寄","explanation":"보내다：送，寄；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"1","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는데","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비용이","meaning":"费，费用","explanation":"비용：费，费用；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비용","audio":"/audio/24423dd67b3a782699d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83163","senseId":"1","lemma":"비용","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마인가요?","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b63128abe65a84d2","term":"택배","zh":"快递","audio":"/audio/b63128abe65a84d203c7.mp3","entryId":"80833","definition":"将邮件、行李、商品等直接送到指定的地方。","pronunciation":["택빼"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"送，寄","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"把人或东西等弄到别的地方去。","pronunciation":["보내다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"打算做（-려고 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"24423dd67b3a7826","term":"비용","zh":"费，费用","audio":"/audio/24423dd67b3a782699d9.mp3","entryId":"83163","definition":"为做某事而花费的钱。","pronunciation":["비ː용"]},{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"不知道的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]}],"audio":"/audio/b61e5c67b5492bb0b35d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28548-1-8-2","ko":"내용물의 무게와 크기에 따라서 달라집니다.","zh":"费用会根据物品的重量和尺寸来决定。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내용물의","meaning":"内容物","explanation":"내용물：内容物；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"내용물","audio":"/audio/c81d7e253641f07ae945.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28548","senseId":"1","lemma":"내용물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무게와","meaning":"重量","explanation":"무게：重量；와：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"무게","audio":"/audio/35f5385457736f8b7af4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54870","senseId":"1","lemma":"무게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"크기에","meaning":"大小，高矮，高低","explanation":"크기：大小，高矮，高低；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"크기","audio":"/audio/82232621b82d72beac66.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62458","senseId":"1","lemma":"크기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"따라서","meaning":"随着","explanation":"따르다：随着；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"따르다","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64547","senseId":"9","lemma":"따르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달라집니다.","meaning":"变，改变","explanation":"달라지다：变，改变；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"달라지다","audio":"/audio/3aa18124b2a7d459478f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62902","senseId":"1","lemma":"달라지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c81d7e253641f07a","term":"내용물","zh":"内容物","audio":"/audio/c81d7e253641f07ae945.mp3","entryId":"28548","definition":"内部含有的东西或物质。","pronunciation":["내ː용물"]},{"id":"35f5385457736f8b","term":"무게","zh":"重量","audio":"/audio/35f5385457736f8b7af4.mp3","entryId":"54870","definition":"物体所受重力的大小程度。","pronunciation":["무게"]},{"id":"82232621b82d72be","term":"크기","zh":"大小，高矮，高低","audio":"/audio/82232621b82d72beac66.mp3","entryId":"62458","definition":"物体的体积、宽度及量等的大小的程度。","pronunciation":["크기"]},{"id":"3ad4e3c6c1e70dee","term":"따르다","zh":"随着","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3","entryId":"64547","definition":"与某对象成比例。","pronunciation":["따르다"]},{"id":"3aa18124b2a7d459","term":"달라지다","zh":"变，改变","audio":"/audio/3aa18124b2a7d459478f.mp3","entryId":"62902","definition":"与以前变得不一样。","pronunciation":["달라지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a9a319801da77604700e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.19,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28548","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":152,"sequenceScore":3.0167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["费用会根据物品的重量和尺寸来决定。","怎么突然肚子会这么疼呢？","我想寄快递，费用是多少呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["费用会根据物品的重量和尺寸来决定。","我想寄快递，费用是多少呢？","怎么突然肚子会这么疼呢？"],"answer":0}]}
